diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -12,11 +12,15 @@

 ### Fixed

+- Light-leak border widths can be increased or decreased directly in Display settings.
+
 - Readest position sync checks for newer matching editions and previews an approximate position when the saved anchor is missing or disagrees with the native location.

 - Image refresh blanks each image separately, keeping text between inline images visible while images are prepared for display. Pending images use an empty background instead of a temporary box border.

 - Saved highlight handles can extend or shorten across adjacent pages in the same chapter; edge dragging loads the actual page and saves once on release.
+
+- SD firmware restarts retain the current frontlight levels and on/off state instead of applying wake scheduling. Highlight controls stay black on white in dark mode. On-page drag editing respects exact highlight endpoints and uses a flat toolbar with thicker icons.

 - Saved highlights stop at the selected text before a joined dash; the floating Edit/Delete toolbar has larger high-contrast icons. Highlights also continue across page breaks inside hyphenated words, without changing saved clipping text.

